    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλάμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine upon</i> or <i>over</i>, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧν ὁ ἥλιος κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				508d
			</span></i>: also c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοὺς στενωπούς</span>
			<i>to light them</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα κατέλαμψεν αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.</u>
				19
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ ἡλίου καταλαμπόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.7.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1070
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ion</u>
				87
			</span></i>(anap.). </div>
